Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: Zig
Upstream-Contact: https://codeberg.org/ziglang/zig/issues
Source: https://ziglang.org/download/
Comment:
 Repacked from upstream's prebuilt binary release tarballs by
 debian/fetch-orig-source.
 .
 lib/ bundles the sources and headers of many third-party projects
 (LLVM, musl, glibc, the Linux kernel UAPI, mingw-w64, wasi-libc, the BSDs
 and Apple's libc). Within each of those trees, the license of each file is
 stated in its header; the stanzas below list the licenses that occur in
 each tree, as found by licensecheck.
 .
 Seven Darwin headers are under the Apple Public Source License 1.1, which
 is not DFSG-free; see their stanza below. This package is therefore not
 suitable for Debian main as-is.

